The meteo input files are updated on 14.10.2025 by J. Blagojevic.
The new climatic input data are extracted basin-mean daily values from the MeteoSwiss products RhiresD, TmaxD, TminD.
The streamflow values are coppied from station data.

The GSTEIG_INPUT data has full length streamflow coverage (1.1.1971-31.12.2023) - USE FOR EXERCISE 2 IN 2025.


*For the curious ones*
Should you want to explore other catchments; There are two data files for each catchment:
-...METEO_NEW, the defualt input files with complete data for all the days (1.10.1985-30.9.2000)
-...METEO_FULL, the longer input files with incomplete data (streamflow only for: 1.10.1985-30.9.2000), the data covers 1.1.1971-31.12.2023